-- -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- TurtleMod test content - GENERATED by gen_test_sql.py. Do not edit by hand.
--
--   * one buff spell per class specialization (27), filed under that spec's
--     spellbook tab and trainable at level 2 from the matching class master
--   * one craft recipe per profession (0) at skill 5, from basic mats
--
-- Run against tw_world. IDEMPOTENT. Requires a mangosd RESTART and the rebuilt
-- patch-6.mpq, which carries the client-side Spell.dbc and SkillLineAbility.dbc rows.
--
-- All spell ids are in the reserved 38xxx block. See TurtleMod/SPELL-IDS.md - ids
-- above 65535 are silently truncated to 16 bits by SMSG_INITIAL_SPELLS and arrive at
-- the client as a completely different spell.
-- -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

USE tw_world;

