-- =====================================================================================
-- PART 2 - 0 profession test recipes at skill 5
--
-- Each craft spell is a clone of that profession's OWN lowest-tier recipe, so it
-- inherits the right RequiresSpellFocus: Cooking needs a fire, Smelting and
-- Jewelcrafting a forge, Enchanting nothing. Cloning across professions would produce
-- a recipe that can never be cast, with no useful error message.
-- =====================================================================================

